   "fix": "Add `coe_rightTranslation_symm` (proved by `BoundedContinuousFunction.compContinuous\u2097\u1d62_symm_apply ..`) and `rightTranslation_symm_apply` (proved by `DFunLike.congr_fun`), mirroring lines 305\u2013312. Then prove `rightTranslation_symm` by `ext; simp [rightTranslation_symm_apply]`, as `leftTranslation_symm` does at line 315.",
   "issue": "`AddUCB.rightTranslation_symm` proves its goal with `rw [rightTranslation_apply]; exact DFunLike.congr_fun (BoundedContinuousFunction.compContinuous\u2097\u1d62_symm_apply (addUcb A) (ContinuousMap.addRight a) (ContinuousMap.addRight (-a)) _ _ _ _ f) x`. This hard-codes the construction's internals and argument order, so it breaks if `compContinuous\u2097\u1d62_symm_apply` changes signature. It also hides the reusable fact `(R_a).symm f = f \u2218 (\u00b7 + -a)`, which `leftTranslation` exposes as `coe_leftTranslation_symm` and `leftTranslation_symm_apply`.",
